WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.163
Give your Mac

00:00:01.046 --> 00:00:01.918
app a truly

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.003
custom About window

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:04.878
Every macOS app

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:05.621
gets a default

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:06.576
About panel showing

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:07.130
the icon

00:00:07.296 --> 00:00:07.897
name

00:00:08.098 --> 00:00:09.217
version and build

00:00:09.029 --> 00:00:09.642
number

00:00:09.781 --> 00:00:11.078
Nil Coalescing shows

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:11.715
how to replace

00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:12.493
it entirely

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.645
Since macOS 13

00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:15.718
the Window scene

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.496
and the openWindow

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:17.629
environment value let

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.112
you build a

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:19.185
fully custom About

00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:20.364
window with standard

00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:21.685
SwiftUI APIs

00:00:22.214 --> 00:00:23.133
You override the

00:00:22.945 --> 00:00:23.971
app info command

00:00:23.782 --> 00:00:24.702
placement with a

00:00:24.514 --> 00:00:25.574
new command group

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:26.482
so the About

00:00:26.294 --> 00:00:26.942
item in the

00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:27.827
app menu opens

00:00:27.639 --> 00:00:28.440
your own window

00:00:28.252 --> 00:00:29.124
with the version

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.280
copyright and a

00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:31.612
developer website link

00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:33.156
Full story on

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.863
the dashboard
